{
  "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base",
  "input": {
    "text": "需要一直观察到几点吗？我现在一个人在家，正常洗澡睡觉可以吧？",
    "language": "Chinese",
    "voice_setting": {
      "voice_id": "qwen3-profile-3496c04aea804b88",
      "seed": 1267105346,
      "voice_profile": "男性，感知年龄二十多岁，音色偏清亮，吐字较快但清楚，整体声音有明显的活力和轻微起伏。",
      "reference_text": "我刚打完羽毛球那局，停下来时突然觉得头有点发飘，坐下喝了几口水就缓过来了。现在没事，但我有点担心，这一般算正常反应吗？",
      "reference_directory": "/ytech_m2v8_hdd/workspace/kling_mm/zhengyuanhong/read_paper/全双工/duplex-env-scaling-package/project/duplex_v2/runs/20261109-v29-user-aside-hundred-service-recovery/branches/G07-N006-R01-V01/R01-V01/audio/voices/user-reference",
